":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.stable, 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nFedora\n\n### Issue description\n\n```GDScript\nextends Node\n\nvar _thread := Thread.new()\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tawait _threaded_work()\n\tget_tree().change_scene_to_file(\"res://secondary.tscn\")\n\n\nfunc _threaded_work() -> void:\n\tvar twork := Twork.new()\n\t_thread.start(twork.work)\n\tawait twork.finished\n\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\t_thread.wait_to_finish()\n```\n> [!CAUTION]\n> main.gd:8 @ _ready(): Changing scene can only be done from the main thread.\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"!Thread::is_main_thread()\" is true. Returning: ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER\n  <C++ Source>  scene/main/scene_tree.cpp:1678 @ change_scene_to_file()\n\nThe message is incorrect. We are calling `change_scene_to_file()` from the main thread. Using `await get_tree().process_frame` before changing scenes or changing scenes with `call_deferred()` fixes the issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[threaded-goodness.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22490875/threaded-goodness.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscr